{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OeWd73lrXS1793571450.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>石油輸出國組織及盟友決定12月繼續維持產量不變。</p><p></p><p>油組表示，沙特阿拉伯、俄羅斯、伊拉克、科威特、哈薩克、阿爾及利亞及阿曼主要產油國，決定12月繼續維持產量不變，維持在9月的水平。聲明指出，各國在分析石油市場現況與前景後作出相關決定，但並未提及維持產量不變的原因。</p><p></p><p>有分析認為，為應對中東衝突對出口造成的影響，油組及盟友明年前不會調整政策，各產油國須於第四季完成生產能力評估，以確定2027年的產量配額。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.496417+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.905739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:44.139594+00:00","content_hash":"f81da62815aed2fe346ab4526507b9b67130b3927a301941cd83f47fc2987958","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.496417+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}